item.miner-plush.name=Miner's Plush
item.miner-plush.description=A goblin plush that wriggles on its own.
character.plush.name=Grizzle
character.plush.epithet=Miner's plush
character.plush-fed.epithet-fed=Well-fed plush
dialogue.plush-fed.text=Ahh, I feel like a proper plush again. Lost in the dark? Just ask.
dialogue.plush-fed.up=Take me up.
dialogue.plush-fed.refused.text=Hmph. I only deal with licensed miners, and nobody signed your licence. Come back when the server says otherwise.
dialogue.plush-fed.refused.answer=Fine.
dialogue.plush-fed.sad=You look sad.
dialogue.plush-fed.home=Here we are, home.
dialogue.plush-fed.story=Tell me your story.
dialogue.plush-fed.story-again=Tell it again.
dialogue.plush-fed.bye=Goodbye.
dialogue.plush-hungry.text=Ten copper, ten iron, ten gold. Raw ore, nothing smelted. My stomach rumbles louder than a cave in.
dialogue.plush-hungry.feed=Here, eat.
dialogue.plush-hungry.give-up=I will not feed you.
dialogue.plush-hungry.later=Later.
dialogue.plush-intro.page1=Stop shaking me! Yes, me, the plush in your pocket. Name's Grizzle.
dialogue.plush-intro.page2=I was a miner's plush, deep under the goblin hills. Copper, iron, gold: I ate it all, and in return I knew every way back to daylight.
dialogue.plush-intro.page3=Now I am starving and stitched up like a rag. Feed me, and I will show you the way up whenever you are lost below.
dialogue.plush-intro.want=What do you want?
dialogue.plush-intro.hush=Hush.
dialogue.plush-mumble.text=Zzz... ğŏŏld... mŏŏŕe ğŏld... zzz...
dialogue.plush-mumble.wake=Wake up.
dialogue.plush-rustle.title=???
dialogue.plush-rustle.text=Ŕŕŗk... ğrůůmm... şşk ŧħŕŏk, ŵŵŕŕŕ... ĝŕĭżż?
dialogue.plush-rustle.what=What is that?
dialogue.plush-story.page1=A goblin foreman sewed me from a sack of ore and the coat of his best digger.
dialogue.plush-story.page2=He hung me on his belt, and every time the tunnel caved in I sniffed the way out. The crew never lost a soul.
dialogue.plush-story.page3=Then the breach swallowed the whole camp, and I was left behind in the dust. Until you came along.
dialogue.plush-story.answer=I see.
router.plush.sniff.text=Sniff... sniff... Is that gold? Do not wave it under my nose like that!
router.plush.sniff.answer=Patience.
chapter.name=The strange plush
quest.plush-appetite.title=Miner's appetite
quest.plush-appetite.description=Grizzle has not eaten since the breach swallowed its camp, and it only eats ore.
quest.plush-appetite.short=Feed ten copper, ten iron and ten gold ore to Grizzle
quest.plush-appetite.copper.title=Ten copper ore
quest.plush-appetite.copper.description=Carry ten copper ore.
quest.plush-appetite.iron.title=Ten iron ore
quest.plush-appetite.iron.description=Carry ten iron ore.
quest.plush-appetite.gold.title=Ten gold ore
quest.plush-appetite.gold.description=Carry ten gold ore.
quest.plush-appetite.feed.title=Feed Grizzle
quest.plush-appetite.feed.description=Hand the ore over to the plush.
quest.plush-home.title=Home at last
quest.plush-home.description=Grizzle is home, among the goblins. Let it tell you so.
quest.plush-home.short=Tell Grizzle it is home, inside the breach
quest.plush-homesick.title=Homesick
quest.plush-homesick.description=Well fed, Grizzle still sighs at night. It misses the goblin hills it came from.
quest.plush-homesick.short=Bring Grizzle through a Goblin Breach
quest.plush-veins.title=First veins
quest.plush-veins.description=Every miner remembers their first glint of metal in the rock.
quest.plush-veins.short=Mine copper, iron and gold ore
quest.plush-veins.copper.title=A copper vein
quest.plush-veins.copper.description=Mine a block of copper ore.
quest.plush-veins.iron.title=An iron vein
quest.plush-veins.iron.description=Mine a block of iron ore.
quest.plush-veins.gold.title=A gold vein
quest.plush-veins.gold.description=Mine a block of gold ore.
quest.plush-voice.title=A voice in the pocket
quest.plush-voice.description=Something in your pocket is rustling. Something that was not there before.
quest.plush-voice.short=Listen to what is moving in your pocket
